  "description": "A secret that I, a maid of the imperial palace, accidentally heard… that the runaway fiancée of the prince was actually a man?! \n\n*\"Please spare my life! I'll do anything!\"*\n*\"Anything?\"* \n\nAs I desperately nodded my head, the prince gave a chilling smile. There's only one way to not get silenced permanently! \n\n*\"Then I choose you.\"*\n*\"For what?\"*\n*\"To be my fiancée.\"*\n\nTo become the fiancée (replacement) of the prince.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)\n\n*Note: This is a promotional one-shot for the homonym novel.*",
